1026
01:17:16,820 --> 01:17:19,820
...so make sure you don't miss out on this chance!

1027
01:17:19,820 --> 01:17:25,320
I want Reine's autograph! I want Reine's autograph!

1028
01:17:25,320 --> 01:17:29,320
Hey, no! Me! Me first! I'm gonna buy real fast!

1029
01:17:30,320 --> 01:17:33,320
Can you beat Mori Calliope's speed?

1030
01:17:33,320 --> 01:17:34,520
Definitely not!

1031
01:17:34,520 --> 01:17:38,320
But I'll see you guys in the pit, let's go! Fighting for Reine's signature!

1032
01:17:38,320 --> 01:17:40,320
Didn't we already fight enough?

1033
01:17:40,320 --> 01:17:41,820
Well, I wanna fight the fans now!

1034
01:17:42,320 --> 01:17:44,120
Yeah, it's their turn now! You guys are next!

1035
01:17:44,320 --> 01:17:48,320
And that wraps up our merch introduction!

1036
01:17:48,320 --> 01:17:50,820
Okay, move! Back, back, back!

1037
01:17:50,820 --> 01:17:57,320
Back where? I forgot where I was! I don't know where I was!

1038
01:17:57,320 --> 01:18:01,320
Okay guys, phew! This year's birthday celebration was so much fun!

1039
01:18:01,320 --> 01:18:05,320
I got to go to two different location shoots...

1040
01:18:05,320 --> 01:18:08,820
...spend time with everyone, and make so many great memories!

1041
01:18:10,320 --> 01:18:15,320
So thank you, thank you so much again for making my birthday so fun!

1042
01:18:15,320 --> 01:18:18,120
You're welcome! Bring it in!

1043
01:18:21,820 --> 01:18:25,320
Reine is one year older! One year older!

1044
01:18:26,120 --> 01:18:28,820
Congrats on getting closer to me!

1045
01:18:29,320 --> 01:18:33,820
Your hair's turning gray! Yours is too!

1046
01:18:36,320 --> 01:18:39,520
And now, before we know it, we've reached the final part of this stream...

1047
01:18:39,520 --> 01:18:43,820
...and it is time for the new song performance!

1048
01:18:44,820 --> 01:18:49,120
Wait, hold on, I gotta show you something! I'm gonna get something!

1049
01:18:49,320 --> 01:18:51,320
What is she getting?

1050
01:18:51,320 --> 01:18:55,120
Is that what I think it is? My beautiful, beautiful baby!

1051
01:18:58,320 --> 01:19:01,320
Bass! It's the Reine bass!

1052
01:19:01,820 --> 01:19:05,820
Love the stickers! You guys recognize these stickers?

1053
01:19:08,820 --> 01:19:15,320
All right, I worked really, really hard on this song, so I hope you all can enjoy it!

1054
01:19:16,320 --> 01:19:21,320
All right, can everyone say the title of the new song together with me?

1055
01:19:22,320 --> 01:19:27,320
せーの！ Endless Blue!
Ready, set... Endless Blue!

1056
01:19:52,320 --> 01:19:57,320
Endless Blue / 作詞：藤原優樹 作曲・編曲：長谷川大介
[Title: Endless Blue / Lyrics: Yuki Fujiwara / Composition & Arrangement: Daisuke Hasegawa]

1057
01:20:06,128 --> 01:20:08,528
飾り付けた言葉でなんて
With decorated words,

1058
01:20:08,528 --> 01:20:11,328
本当の鼓動隠してたんだ
I was hiding my true heartbeat.

1059
01:20:11,328 --> 01:20:13,928
折りたたんだ羽は
My folded wings

1060
01:20:13,928 --> 01:20:16,828
見えない空に焦がれてたんだ
were yearning for an unseen sky.

1061
01:20:16,828 --> 01:20:19,328
外れるなら壊してしまった
If it was off, I ended up breaking it,

1062
01:20:19,328 --> 01:20:21,528
散らばる欠片 バラバラ
the scattered fragments all scattered about.

1063
01:20:21,528 --> 01:20:23,628
誰かに似た色じゃ
A color similar to someone else's...

1064
01:20:23,628 --> 01:20:26,528
意味がない わかってるから
...has no meaning, because I know that.

1065
01:20:26,528 --> 01:20:31,128
旅立ちはあの青空のせいだ
This departure is all thanks to that blue sky.

1066
01:20:31,328 --> 01:20:33,728
誤魔化せない
I can't play dumb,

1067
01:20:33,728 --> 01:20:37,828
憧れに気づいたから
because I've realized my longing.

1068
01:20:37,828 --> 01:20:42,528
どうしようもない衝動に駆られて
Driven by an uncontrollable impulse,

1069
01:20:42,528 --> 01:20:46,928
動き出したストーリーの先には
beyond the story that has begun to move...

1070
01:20:46,928 --> 01:20:52,128
不安も物思いさえも染めていく
...even anxiety and contemplation are painted over.

1071
01:20:52,128 --> 01:20:58,928
想像より今眩しい空が広がってるはずでしょう
A sky brighter than imagination must be spreading out right now, right?

1072
01:20:58,928 --> 01:21:01,928
扉を開け行こう
Let's open the door and go.

1073
01:21:10,128 --> 01:21:15,128
ヤミヤミ沈む昨日 Love Me Love Me叫び痛む今日も
Darkly sinking yesterday, crying "Love Me" in pain today too,

1074
01:21:15,128 --> 01:21:20,128
今更なんて言ってた願いの色はくすんでいた
the color of wishes I deemed "too late now" had faded.

1075
01:21:20,128 --> 01:21:23,128
痛みなら飲み干してしまおう
If it's pain, let's swallow it all down.

1076
01:21:23,128 --> 01:21:25,528
また乗り越えてみせるよ
I'll show you I can overcome it again.

1077
01:21:25,528 --> 01:21:30,128
私でいることにためらう弱さはもういらない
I no longer need the weakness of hesitating to be myself.

1078
01:21:30,128 --> 01:21:35,128
広げた羽は飾りじゃないよ
These spread wings aren't for decoration.

1079
01:21:35,128 --> 01:21:38,928
鮮やかな夢を纏おう
Let's adorn ourselves with vivid dreams.

1080
01:21:38,928 --> 01:21:45,528
その覚悟がここにあるから
Because that determination is right here.

1081
01:22:02,328 --> 01:22:06,728
幻想の夜重ねて
Overlaying nights of illusion,

1082
01:22:06,728 --> 01:22:10,928
ぶらり漂うように歩いていたよ
I was walking as if drifting aimlessly.

1083
01:22:10,928 --> 01:22:16,128
途方案なく遠くて挫けそうになっても
Even if it's hopelessly far and I feel like giving up,

1084
01:22:16,128 --> 01:22:23,828
この声は羽ばたけるその時を待っていたんだ
this voice was waiting for the moment it could take flight.

1085
01:22:23,828 --> 01:22:27,828
もう一度叫んでみるよ
I'll try shouting once more.

1086
01:22:27,828 --> 01:22:32,528
終わりなんてない旅を続けたくて
Wanting to continue a journey that has no end,

1087
01:22:32,528 --> 01:22:37,828
進んでいくストーリーの向こうへと
toward the other side of the advancing story...

1088
01:22:37,828 --> 01:22:43,128
この声で果てない空を渡っていく
...with this voice, I'll cross the endless sky.

1089
01:22:43,128 --> 01:22:47,128
まだ知らない遥かな青に
Toward an as-yet-unknown, distant blue,

1090
01:22:47,128 --> 01:22:50,128
胸を膨らませて
with my heart swelling,

1091
01:22:50,128 --> 01:22:54,928
無限の明日がきっと待ってるから
because an infinite tomorrow is surely waiting.

1092
01:22:54,928 --> 01:22:58,328
扉を開け行こう
Let's open the door and go.

